  "title": "Parisian Potatoes",
  "description": "Parisian potatoes are essentially a round, butter-flavored French fry. A treat for date night.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-09-23T09:00:00-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-07-20T17:10:22-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT10M",
  "cook_time": "PT20M",
  "total_time": "PT60M",
  "yield": [
    "2"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Side Dish"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "French"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "French"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 large russet potatoes, peeled",
    "4 cups water",
    "2 tablespoons kosher salt",
    "2 tablespoons clarified butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gyoJWr7d_DqabZJoLnCWsljz0XA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-step-01-da65efde4dc040038fff5fdb3b6bc064.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scoop out as many potato balls as you can per potato using the smaller end of a Parisian scooper, 8 or 9 balls per large potato. You can't get too many out of each potato. If you want perfectly shaped balls, don't scoop too close together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u4zrULIp1cMl4TC0HRkciFEsT-8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-step-02-e7567210ffb2488f992f378abc73d2f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop potato balls into a large bowl of cold fresh water so they don't discolor. Use potato carcasses for another use, e.g. potato pancakes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2NYzuFo9CS4Ef3oGvstdfiT_vjg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-step-03-aae74a3de7304f37b36cc0e5c5dd74fe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add potato balls, water, and kosher salt to a large pot. Stir and bring to a boil over medium-high heat. Once water is boiling, boil for just 2 minutes. Potatoes should still be firm, but not raw.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VzERJLIl2INzzk_wmXA4Dl7x0J0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-step-04-fb0043571533458d892a97adc8b99cbc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn off heat and remove potato balls with a strainer. Allow to drain in one layer on a plate lined with paper towels. Cool until they are room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/df9hS2iAv6yEK3xrFZJHXDRpXug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-step-05-da117469900145af9b4708f9b0de5954.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat clarified butter in a skillet over medium heat for 2 minutes. Carefully add completely dry and cooled potatoes to butter. Brown potatoes until outsides are golden and crispy, and the insides are tender and fluffy, 7 to 10 minutes. Move and stir potatoes often so they brown evenly .",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ov-Zqf3yKYaYvPkJlOXlaDWXz9c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-step-06-fa61f26149594339b035b62ffd4a2049.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MkI8z2U_8vxZuxTM6YsPAtVF-U8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8481345-parisian-potatoes-VAT-01-4x3-80efd5b20ea04166ab8b3763ea7dfc1e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8481345/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
